  output-dir not listed when extra files forbidden + guardrail-only rubric missing positive-quality
  check (task 53). REVERTED an over-eager "derived facts are completeness" carve-out — it raised the
  salience of the count issue and REGRESSED task_116 (construct sev2 1/3 -> 3/3); replaced by the
  golden-over-strict lever (5). input_prompt_leakage unchanged (expert "disagree" was re-review
  scope, not gate validity). SETTLED state, verified over 3-run passes: task_53 & task_111 stable
  accepting, task_24 stable reject (leakage); task_48/116 remain a known judgment-boundary flicker
